{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"wand_grand_magician","model_identifier":"wand_grand_magician","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## wand_grand_magician\n\nMage wand, Grand Magician.\n\n- Cubes: 10 (0 rotated). Texture 32x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.8..1.8, y -1.8..1.8, z -11.5..3.8 (size 3.5 x 3.5 x 15.2 u = 10 x 10 x 43 cm).\nRank 6 of 6 (Grand Magician). Grand Magician wand: ornate: silver-chequered grip, gold collar, cap, four-way gold wings round a large radiant gem with a bright point, a small gem in the gold pommel. About 43 cm. Held in slot_hand_r: grip at the origin, tip forward (-Z). The gem cube is named `glow_*` so the game can light it (violet).\n"},"description":"## wand_grand_magician\n\nMage wand, Grand Magician.\n\n- Cubes: 10 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32 (padded from 32x16; UVs unchanged), 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.8..1.8, y -1.8..1.8, z -11.5..3.8 (size 3.5 x 3.5 x 15.2 u = 10 x 10 x 43 cm).\nRank 6 of 6 (Grand Magician). Grand Magician wand: ornate: silver-chequered grip, gold collar, cap, four-way gold wings round a large radiant gem with a bright point, a small gem in the gold pommel. About 43 cm. Held in slot_hand_r: grip at the origin, tip forward (-Z). The gem cube is named `glow_*` so the game can light it (violet).\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"pommel","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.75,-0.75,2.0],"to":[0.75,0.75,3.25],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[18,0,19.5,1.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[20,0,21.25,1.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[22,0,23.5,1.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[24,0,25.25,1.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[26,0,27.5,1.25],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[28,0,29